aracter not being where they should be—you’ll need to track them down on the cameras and defend yourself however you can.\n\nCan you survive a week of Brainrot Nights?","path":"/game/100635310803794-brainrot-nights","slug":"100635310803794-brainrot-nights","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/caa759ee1f2a2ae7c17548c6497090118d4b196584090da76901b6afd1a1a255.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ac2d8875b625e449284ba1f09aa0efb1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":7291,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-13T07:01:47.831Z","creator":{"name":"B_Ketchup","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":84466219952510,"name":" [🧲] Collect Coins","desc":"⚡ COLLECT COINS ⚡\nBecome the ULTIMATE Coin Collector!\n\nGrab your magnet and start your coin empire! Pull massive amounts of coins, unlock legendary pets, and dominate the leaderboards! 💰\n\n🔥 HOW TO PLAY: \n🧲 COLLECT: Use your Magnet to gather Coins around the map! \n💵 UPGRADE: Unlock stronger magnets and boost your collection speed!\n⚡ MULTIPLIER MADNESS - Stack boosts to become unstoppable!\n🐾 RARE PETS: Find pets around the map which give you multipliers, can you collect them all?\n🖥️ AFK: Collect Coins while AFK\n\n👍 LIKE for more updates!⭐ FAVORITE to never miss new content! JOIN the coin collector community!\n\n[Early Access] - Found a bug? Drop feedback and help us make the game even better!\n","path":"/game/84466219952510-collect-coins","slug":"84466219952510-collect-coins","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9cc4e935054203555240e13b8b9107f2855e0d5c46b1d9b405d961e339641e80.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fa026f6d2ebe43951965c379d448d21e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1105000,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-13T20:33:00.009Z","creator":{"name":"Mega Coin Collectors","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":71595674306175,"name":"[WORLD EVENT, ZOMBIE